src/core/frictionProposals.ts	`Generated by \`friction propose\` from the friction ledger: each run's event stream was diagnosed by \`analyzeRunFriction\` ([docs/reference/specs/run-friction.md](https://github.com/coreplanelabs/switchboard/blob/main/docs/reference/specs/run-friction.md)) and the diagnoses clustered across runs ([docs/reference/specs/self-improvement.md](https://github.com/coreplanelabs/switchboard/blob/main/docs/reference/specs/self-improvement.md)). Finding text is redacted at the source. Dedupe key \`${p.key}\`: re-running the pass will not refile this pattern while this issue is open.`,
src/core/frictionProposals.test.ts	expect(p.body).toContain("#84");

